{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-seven-days-song","version":1,"title":"Seven Days, Seven Ways (a song)","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"On Monday we sweep and tidy the floor.\nOn Tuesday we count and count some more.","sentences":["On Monday we sweep and tidy the floor.","On Tuesday we count and count some more."],"alt":"Children sweep a classroom and count pebbles.","image":{"hash":"sha256:caf547dbcc4a4cd66f90bb00d42998a096c9139ae0d34213c4e19a3fe40f8dc7","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:3d8fafb6e6503a29dcc5f03c6c989726c927262d4bc928412b0795ae296f3d7d","durationMs":10360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5376],[5376,10360]],"words":[[0,262],[262,1049],[1049,1311],[1311,1967],[1967,2360],[2360,2885],[2885,3278],[3278,5376],[5376,5638],[5638,6556],[6556,6818],[6818,7474],[7474,7867],[7867,8523],[8523,9048],[9048,10360]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"On Wednesday we draw with a crayon or two.\nOn Thursday we sing a song for you.","sentences":["On Wednesday we draw with a crayon or two.","On Thursday we sing a song for you."],"alt":"Children draw pictures and sing in a circle.","image":{"hash":"sha256:c99921d147e4095a330a4f4927f23f787179fa6f8df912286184f45068e446b4","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:ae4483d45013c03ebb173665711605ea659aeb53abff4e6a94d2df89d58faef9","durationMs":9120,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5196],[5196,9120]],"words":[[0,231],[231,1270],[1270,1501],[1501,1963],[1963,2425],[2425,2656],[2656,3349],[3349,3580],[3580,5196],[5196,5427],[5427,6351],[6351,6582],[6582,7044],[7044,7275],[7275,7737],[7737,8083],[8083,9120]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"On Friday we read a story with a friend.\nOn Saturday we play until day’s end.","sentences":["On Friday we read a story with a friend.","On Saturday we play until day’s end."],"alt":"Two children read a book and then play outdoors.","imag